OL,3,GNEWSAGrieving otter 'coming to terms'
OL,4,Awith dad's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn otter has been getting extra treats
OL,7,Fand attention as he starts "coming to
OL,8,Fterms" with the death of his father,
OL,9,Fstaff have said.
OL,11,FBuster is now the only otter at
OL,12,FWashington Wetland Centre, near
OL,13,FSunderland, after his dad Musa died at
OL,14,Fthe age of 17 last week.
OL,16,FLiving collections manager Mark Tabone
OL,17,Fsaid the duo had a "typical father and
OL,18,Fson dynamic" and did everything
OL,19,Ftogether.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
