OL,3,GNEWSAGrieving otter 'coming to terms'
OL,4,Awith dad's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are hopes to find Buster a
OL,7,Fcompanion, but until then "he's got his
OL,8,Fmembers that come and see him every
OL,9,Fweek and he knows his familiar faces,"
OL,10,FTabone said. "I think that'll
OL,11,Fdefinitely guide him through this
OL,12,Fgrieving process."
